#: docs/wide-gamut-protocol.rst:2
msgid "Wide gamut colors"
msgstr "广色域颜色"

#: docs/wide-gamut-protocol.rst:6
msgid ""
"Terminal colors are sRGB. Most displays made in the last few years can show colors outside that "
"gamut, the deeper reds and greens of Display P3 and the still larger Rec. 2020 gamut, but a "
"program has no way to ask for them. This extension lets a program say which gamut an RGB color is"
" in, using a slot the existing escape code already has, so that nothing changes for programs that"
" do not use it."
msgstr ""
"终端颜色采用 sRGB。近年来多数显示器能显示超出该色域的颜色，例如 Display P3 更深的红绿，以及范围更大的 Rec. "
"2020，但程序原本无法请求这些颜色。本扩展使用现有转义序列中已预留的位置，让程序声明 RGB 颜色所属色域，不影响未使用它的程序。"

#: docs/wide-gamut-protocol.rst:14
msgid "Choosing a gamut"
msgstr "选择色域"

#: docs/wide-gamut-protocol.rst:16
msgid ""
"The colon form of the RGB color SGR has an optional color space id between the ``2`` and the red "
"component, defined in ITU-T T.416 but never given a meaning by terminals, which skip it. This "
"extension gives it one::"
msgstr "RGB 颜色 SGR 的冒号形式，在 ``2`` 和红色分量之间有一个可选色彩空间 ID。它由 ITU-T T.416 定义，但终端此前未赋予含义，只是跳过。本扩展为它定义如下含义：::"

#: docs/wide-gamut-protocol.rst:23
msgid ""
"``id`` is ``0`` for sRGB, which is the same as leaving it out, ``1`` for Display P3 and ``2`` for"
" Rec. 2020. Any other id is treated as ``0``. The components are 0 to 255, encoded with the sRGB "
"transfer curve in every gamut, so only the primaries change with the id and a terminal needs a "
"single curve. The brightest red of Display P3 is::"
msgstr ""
"``id`` 为 ``0`` 表示 sRGB，与省略相同；``1`` 表示 Display P3，``2`` 表示 Rec. 2020。其他 ID 按 ``0`` 处理。分量范围 0 至 "
"255，在所有色域中都用 sRGB 传递曲线编码，因此 ID 只改变基色，终端只需要一种曲线。最亮的 Display P3 红色为：::"

#: docs/wide-gamut-protocol.rst:31
msgid ""
"The gamut belongs to the RGB color it was given with. Selecting one of the sixteen basic colors, "
"a color from the 256 color palette or the default color also selects sRGB, as does an RGB color "
"without an id. Under reverse video the gamut follows the color, so a reversed cell with a Display"
" P3 foreground shows a Display P3 background. Decorations, underline and strikethrough, use the "
"foreground and its gamut unless a decoration color is set with ``58``, which is always sRGB."
msgstr ""
"色域属于与其一同指定的 RGB 颜色。选择十六种基本色、256 色调色板颜色、默认色，或不带 ID 的 RGB 色时，也会选择 sRGB。反显时色域跟随颜色，因此前景为 Display P3 "
"的反显单元会显示 Display P3 背景。下划线和删除线等装饰使用前景及其色域，除非通过 ``58`` 设置装饰色，后者始终为 sRGB。"

#: docs/wide-gamut-protocol.rst:39
msgid ""
"Terminals that do not know the id skip it, so a program can emit the id unconditionally and get "
"the same color interpreted as sRGB elsewhere, which is a little less saturated and never wrong. "
"The id is only recognized in the colon form. The semicolon form ``<ESC>[38;2;<r>;<g>;<b>m`` has "
"no id, since the parameters it is followed by are unrelated attributes."
msgstr ""
"不认识 ID 的终端会跳过它，因此程序可无条件发送，在其他终端上将相同分量解释为 sRGB，饱和度稍低但不会产生错误。ID 仅在冒号形式中识别。分号形式 "
"``<ESC>[38;2;<r>;<g>;<b>m`` 没有 ID，因为随后的参数属于无关属性。"

#: docs/wide-gamut-protocol.rst:46
msgid "Images"
msgstr "图像"

#: docs/wide-gamut-protocol.rst:48
msgid ""
"The pixels of an image sent with the :doc:`graphics-protocol` are sRGB as well. The ``G`` key of "
"a command that transmits them says otherwise, with the ids used for text::"
msgstr "通过 :doc:`graphics-protocol` 发送的图像像素默认也为 sRGB。传输命令的 ``G`` 键可使用与文本相同的 ID 声明其他色域：::"

#: docs/wide-gamut-protocol.rst:54
msgid ""
"``G=1`` is Display P3 and ``G=2`` is Rec. 2020. ``G=0``, any other value and no key at all are "
"sRGB. As for text, the components are encoded with the sRGB transfer curve in every gamut. The "
"key applies to RGB and RGBA data, ``f=24`` and ``f=32``, and belongs in the first chunk of a "
"chunked transmission. It applies in the same way to the pixels of a GPU surface, ``t=g``. It is "
"ignored for ``f=64``, whose pixels are linear extended sRGB by definition, see the :doc:`hdr-"
"protocol`. A vector image, ``f=200``, also ignores ``G``: each paint names its own color space in"
" the :doc:`vector-protocol`. Vector text, paths, gradients and embedded images share a linear "
"extended-sRGB compositor and retain wide-gamut and HDR values through clipping and blending."
msgstr ""
"``G=1`` 为 Display P3，``G=2`` 为 Rec. 2020；``G=0``、其他值或省略键均为 sRGB。与文本一样，全部色域分量都用 sRGB 传递曲线编码。该键适用于 "
"RGB 和 RGBA 数据（``f=24`` 和 ``f=32``），分块传输时应位于首块。它同样适用于 GPU 表面 ``t=g`` 的像素。``f=64`` 忽略该键，因为按定义它是线性扩展"
" sRGB，见 :doc:`hdr-protocol`。矢量图像 ``f=200`` 也忽略 ``G``：每种绘制色在 :doc:`vector-protocol` "
"中各自指定色彩空间。矢量文本、路径、渐变和内嵌图像共用线性扩展 sRGB 合成器，裁剪与混合过程会保留广色域和 HDR 值。"

#: docs/wide-gamut-protocol.rst:65
msgid ""
"A PNG image, ``f=100``, says what its colors are by itself, and the key is ignored for it. A PNG "
"is in Display P3 or Rec. 2020 when its embedded profile has the primaries of that gamut, whatever"
" the curve of the profile, or when its ``cICP`` chunk names those primaries together with the "
"sRGB transfer function. Any other PNG is sRGB, converted to it if it carries a profile, as it "
"always was."
msgstr ""
"PNG 图像 ``f=100`` 自行描述颜色，因此忽略此键。当内嵌配置文件的基色属于 Display P3 或 Rec. 2020 时（无论其曲线如何），或 ``cICP`` 块指定这些基色与"
" sRGB 传递函数时，PNG 就属于相应色域。其他 PNG 按以往方式处理为 sRGB，带配置文件时先转换到 sRGB。"

#: docs/wide-gamut-protocol.rst:72
msgid ""
"All the frames of an animated image are in the gamut of the image, which is that of the data it "
"was created with. A frame transmitted in another gamut is converted to that of the image when it "
"is loaded, so a program may send every frame as it has it."
msgstr "动画图像的所有帧都属于图像创建数据的色域。以其他色域传输的帧会在加载时转换到图像色域，因此程序可按每帧现有色域直接发送。"

#: docs/wide-gamut-protocol.rst:77
msgid ""
"Unlike the id of a text color, the key is not skipped by a terminal that does not know it: such a"
" terminal may reject the whole command, without an answer. A program therefore asks first, with "
"the query action of the graphics protocol and a single pixel::"
msgstr "与文本颜色 ID 不同，不认识该键的终端可能不会跳过它，而是拒绝整条命令且不回复。因此程序应先使用图形协议查询操作，附带单个像素：::"

#: docs/wide-gamut-protocol.rst:84
msgid "and sends the key only to a terminal that answers ``OK``."
msgstr "只向回答 ``OK`` 的终端发送此键。"

#: docs/wide-gamut-protocol.rst:87
msgid "What the terminal does with it"
msgstr "终端如何处理色域"

#: docs/wide-gamut-protocol.rst:89
msgid ""
"The terminal converts a color tagged with a gamut to the gamut it draws in, through CIE XYZ, and "
"clips what the display cannot show. Colors without an id are what they always were, the "
"terminal's own colorspace, and are not touched, so programs that do not use the id are rendered "
"exactly as they were before this extension existed. When a terminal draws in sRGB, a Display P3 "
"or Rec. 2020 color is shown as the nearest sRGB color, which is close to, though not the same as,"
" reading its components as sRGB. Only when the terminal draws in a wider gamut do the extra "
"colors appear. An image in a gamut is converted in the same way, and an image without one is "
"drawn exactly as before."
msgstr ""
"终端通过 CIE XYZ 将标注色域的颜色转换到绘制色域，并裁剪显示器无法显示的颜色。没有 ID 的颜色仍按原来的终端自身色彩空间处理，不做修改，因此不使用 ID "
"的程序与扩展出现前完全相同。终端在 sRGB 中绘制时，Display P3 或 Rec. 2020 色会显示为最接近的 sRGB 色，这与直接按 sRGB "
"解读分量接近但不完全相同。只有终端在更宽色域中绘制时，额外颜色才会显现。标注色域的图像采用相同转换，未标注图像保持原有行为。"

#: docs/wide-gamut-protocol.rst:99
msgid ""
"A program that wants to know whether asking for wide gamut colors is worthwhile asks for the "
"``gamut`` of the display with the ``display`` query of the display information protocol, where "
"the terminal has one, and otherwise simply emits the id. Brightness above SDR white is a separate"
" attribute, the ``56`` and ``57`` of the HDR brightness protocol, and the two combine: a Display "
"P3 red at twice SDR white is ``<ESC>[38:2:1:255:0:0m<ESC>[56:200m``."
msgstr ""
"程序若要判断请求广色域是否值得，可在支持显示信息协议的终端中，通过 ``display`` 查询显示器的 ``gamut``；否则可直接发送文本颜色 ID。高于 SDR "
"白色的亮度属于独立属性，即 HDR 亮度协议的 ``56`` 和 ``57``，两者可以组合：两倍 SDR 白色亮度的 Display P3 红色为 "
"``<ESC>[38:2:1:255:0:0m<ESC>[56:200m``。"

#: docs/wide-gamut-protocol.rst:108
msgid "In Silkie"
msgstr "Silkie 中的实现"

#: docs/wide-gamut-protocol.rst:110
msgid ""
"In Silkie the gamut is stored with the color of the cell and survives everything the color "
"survives: scrollback, copying with formatting, and ``DECRQSS`` reports of the current SGR state, "
"which include the id when it is not ``0``. On macOS the window draws in the colorspace selected "
"by :opt:`macos_colorspace`, and tagged colors are converted to it: with ``srgb`` Display P3 and "
"Rec. 2020 colors are clipped to sRGB, with ``displayp3`` Display P3 colors are shown as they are "
"and Rec. 2020 colors are clipped to Display P3, while untagged colors keep being interpreted as "
"Display P3, as that option has always done. With ``default`` the window is in the native "
"colorspace of the display and every color is passed through unconverted."
msgstr ""
"在 Silkie 中，色域与单元颜色一起保存，随颜色保留于回滚、带格式复制及当前 SGR 状态的 ``DECRQSS`` 报告中；ID 非 ``0`` 时报告包含该 ID。macOS 窗口在 "
":opt:`macos_colorspace` 选择的色彩空间中绘制，已标注颜色转换到该空间：``srgb`` 会将 Display P3 和 Rec. 2020 裁剪到 "
"sRGB；``displayp3`` 原样显示 Display P3，将 Rec. 2020 裁剪到 Display P3，而未标注颜色仍按此选项一贯的方式解释为 Display "
"P3。``default`` 使用显示器原生色彩空间，全部颜色不经转换直接传递。"

#: docs/wide-gamut-protocol.rst:121
msgid ""
"On Wayland the window draws in sRGB unless :opt:`wayland_colorspace` asks for ``displayp3``, "
"``rec2020`` or ``auto`` and the compositor implements color management, the ``color-"
"management-v1`` protocol. The compositor is then told that the window is in that gamut, and "
"colors and images tagged with a gamut are converted to it: in a ``displayp3`` window Display P3 "
"colors are shown as they are and Rec. 2020 colors are clipped to Display P3. Unlike on macOS, "
"untagged colors stay sRGB: they are converted to the gamut of the window as well, so everything "
"that does not ask for a wider gamut looks as it does in an sRGB window. ``auto`` picks the widest"
" of the three gamuts whose primaries the display reaches, going by what the compositor reports "
"for it. The option takes effect on existing windows when the configuration is reloaded."
msgstr ""
"在 Wayland 上，窗口默认使用 sRGB，除非 :opt:`wayland_colorspace` 请求 ``displayp3``、``rec2020`` 或 "
"``auto``，且合成器实现 ``color-management-v1`` 色彩管理协议。此时向合成器声明窗口所属色域，标注颜色和图像均转换到该色域：在 ``displayp3`` "
"窗口中，Display P3 原样显示，Rec. 2020 裁剪到 Display P3。与 macOS 不同，未标注颜色仍为 sRGB，也会转换到窗口色域，所以未请求广色域的内容与 sRGB "
"窗口外观相同。``auto`` 依据合成器报告，在三种色域中选择显示器基色能够覆盖的最宽者。重新加载配置时，此选项对已有窗口生效。"

#: docs/wide-gamut-protocol.rst:133
msgid ""
"The window is declared to the compositor with the primaries of its gamut and a gamma of 2.2, the "
"display the colors of a terminal are made for and what a compositor takes a window that declares "
"nothing to be. Grays therefore have the same values in a wide window as in an sRGB one. The "
"conversion between primaries is done in the linear light of the sRGB curve, as all blending in "
"Silkie is, which can move a saturated untagged color by one step in 255 from what an sRGB window "
"shows. A compositor that offers no gamma of 2.2 is given the sRGB curve instead. On a compositor "
"without the protocol, and on X11, the window draws in sRGB."
msgstr ""
"向合成器声明窗口的色域基色和 2.2 伽马；终端颜色原本面向这种显示特性，合成器也按此理解未作声明的窗口。因此，广色域窗口与 sRGB 窗口的灰度数值相同。基色转换在 sRGB "
"曲线的线性光空间中进行，与 Silkie 的全部混合一致，可能使未标注的饱和色相对于 sRGB 窗口在 255 级中偏移一级。若合成器不提供 2.2 伽马，则改为声明 sRGB "
"曲线。在无此协议的合成器及 X11 上，窗口使用 sRGB。"

#: docs/wide-gamut-protocol.rst:143
msgid ""
"A window that also shows HDR, see :opt:`hdr` and the :doc:`hdr-protocol`, has a single "
"description like any other, and it carries both: the primaries of the gamut chosen here, linear "
"values in place of the gamma, and the luminances the contents reach. Colors are converted to the "
"gamut of the window as above, and what is brighter than SDR white stays so in that gamut. When "
"the compositor does not take linear values in the wide primaries, the window keeps its HDR and is"
" drawn in sRGB; when the window cannot show HDR at all, it is a wide window as described above."
msgstr ""
"同时显示 HDR 的窗口（见 :opt:`hdr` 和 :doc:`hdr-"
"protocol`）与其他窗口一样只有一份描述，同时包含此处选择的基色、代替伽马的线性值，以及内容达到的亮度。颜色按上述方式转换到窗口色域，高于 SDR "
"白色的亮度在该色域中仍被保留。如果合成器不接受广色域基色的线性值，窗口保留 HDR，改用 sRGB；如果完全不能显示 HDR，则按上文描述作为广色域窗口。"

#: docs/wide-gamut-protocol.rst:152
msgid ""
"The profile of a PNG is taken to be Display P3 or Rec. 2020 when each of its three primaries is "
"within 0.005 in x and in y of the primary of that gamut, both adapted to the D50 white point "
"profiles are made for. The pixels are then converted from the curve of the profile to the sRGB "
"curve and nothing else. Other uses of PNG in Silkie, such as background images and window logos, "
"are sRGB as before."
msgstr ""
"若 PNG 配置文件的三种基色，分别在 x 和 y 上与 Display P3 或 Rec. 2020 对应基色相差不超过 0.005（双方均适应配置文件使用的 D50 "
"白点），则认定为该色域。像素仅从配置文件曲线转换到 sRGB 曲线，不做其他变换。Silkie 中背景图、窗口标志等其他 PNG 用途仍按以往方式使用 sRGB。"

